# Testing Standards

## Stack
- Unit/integration: Vitest + jsdom (or happy-dom)
- E2E: Playwright
- HTTP mocking: MSW (when fetch is involved)

## Principles
- Test user-visible behavior, not implementation details
- Co-locate: `login-form.js` ↔ `login-form.test.js`
- Name tests by behavior: `it('shows an error when email is empty')`
- E2E for critical flows: auth, form submission, navigation
- Use `getByRole` / `getByLabelText` in Playwright

## Coverage Focus
- Critical paths: auth, data mutations, form validation
- Accessibility smoke: focusable elements, form labels
- Do not test browser APIs or trivial utilities
